OL,3,AMahmood scraps settlement plans for
OL,4,Amigrant care workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives said Mahmood's
OL,7,F"U-turn" would cost taxpayers billions
OL,8,Fof pounds.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
